{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual roguelike game where you become nanomachines to protect the human body from viruses and bacteria.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time progresses, the human body ages and becomes increasingly vulnerable to viruses, bacteria, cancer cells, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/606c35692ef16bd3e9a5ecec199fb4df.poster.avif?t=1771479012\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/606c35692ef16bd3e9a5ecec199fb4df.webm?t=1771479012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nanomachines come with a power-up feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire various weapons and eliminate external threats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viruses and bacteria become stronger over time, so strategically upgrade your weapons to stay ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/2e9710a9fca29fe5a3cf52a2474b34eb.poster.avif?t=1771479012\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/2e9710a9fca29fe5a3cf52a2474b34eb.webm?t=1771479012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nanomachine weapons can evolve into extremely powerful \u201cSynthesis Weapons\u201d when specific conditions are met.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different combinations and discover them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/f05fce3ede510e91599294a056461cdd.poster.avif?t=1771479012\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/f05fce3ede510e91599294a056461cdd.webm?t=1771479012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Tips:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFocus on collecting experience points first. Start by defeating enemies you can handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSurvival is key in the early game. Master the art of dodging and running away effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbLook for items on the map. Don\u2019t miss chances to heal or power up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFind weapons that suit your playstyle. Your strategy will change depending on the combinations you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Actively obtain Synthesis Weapons to gain the advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synthesis Weapon Recipes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/17ac571884c7b449ee30180ba9937e84.avif?t=1771479012\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone is free to stream this game, and no prior permission is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you stream the game, we\u2019ll do our best to share it as much as possible. To make it easier for us to find, please use the hashtag <strong>#VirusHunter</strong> when posting about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, you can notify us directly on X (Twitter) at <strong>@kenjikatou</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> The use of this game for illegal activities, unethical purposes, or anything that violates public order and morals is strictly prohibited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bug Reports</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find any bugs in the game, please report them via the Community Hub discussion board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Takedown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2908820/7da2e1b36b132718774580917f9da55206654a19.jpg"},{"name":"Elite Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2908820/4139047921ca3b79b2c02bf62aa3e5ac9a498f5d.jpg"},{"name":"Virus Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2908820/f9c72ae2ff6479e3359295ff16655a8cd09c0325.jpg"},{"name":"Nemesis Cleanse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2908820/9a916f9467673f6acfe660345d2aa9a2252d2a82.jpg"},{"name":"Serious Damage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2908820/18cd3e6e688f4d573854d39794a92f8983f427a3.jpg"},{"name":"Massive Damage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2908820/5a4c048173ecc9fe903ca01131b9c4d41e51b0fa.jpg"},{"name":"Unbelievable Damage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2908820/d50dd011e19e6d9c7177c34b7223bc61bffdf199.jpg"},{"name":"Wealthy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2908820/79ad3d55f557a5a6c1dce6ef5e182395ec44c81b.jpg"},{"name":"Tycoon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2908820/80883f1a94521853bbdc7b410a35d872e24417a3.jpg"},{"name":"First Upgrade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2908820/5773058f9867d12e28fab291c7f550342527089f.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2908820?t=1771479012","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2908820?t=1771479012","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/39bba99c194bdb6dbf95b0eed2e88c6b4b7a6dc7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771479012","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/39bba99c194bdb6dbf95b0eed2e88c6b4b7a6dc7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771479012","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual roguelike game where you become nanomachines to protect the human body from viruses and bacteria.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time progresses, the human body ages and becomes increasingly vulnerable to viruses, bacteria, cancer cells, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/606c35692ef16bd3e9a5ecec199fb4df.poster.avif?t=1771479012\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/606c35692ef16bd3e9a5ecec199fb4df.webm?t=1771479012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nanomachines come with a power-up feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire various weapons and eliminate external threats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viruses and bacteria become stronger over time, so strategically upgrade your weapons to stay ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/2e9710a9fca29fe5a3cf52a2474b34eb.poster.avif?t=1771479012\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/2e9710a9fca29fe5a3cf52a2474b34eb.webm?t=1771479012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nanomachine weapons can evolve into extremely powerful \u201cSynthesis Weapons\u201d when specific conditions are met.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different combinations and discover them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/f05fce3ede510e91599294a056461cdd.poster.avif?t=1771479012\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/f05fce3ede510e91599294a056461cdd.webm?t=1771479012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Tips:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFocus on collecting experience points first. Start by defeating enemies you can handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSurvival is key in the early game. Master the art of dodging and running away effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbLook for items on the map. Don\u2019t miss chances to heal or power up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFind weapons that suit your playstyle. Your strategy will change depending on the combinations you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Actively obtain Synthesis Weapons to gain the advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synthesis Weapon Recipes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/extras/17ac571884c7b449ee30180ba9937e84.avif?t=1771479012\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone is free to stream this game, and no prior permission is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you stream the game, we\u2019ll do our best to share it as much as possible. To make it easier for us to find, please use the hashtag <strong>#VirusHunter</strong> when posting about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, you can notify us directly on X (Twitter) at <strong>@kenjikatou</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> The use of this game for illegal activities, unethical purposes, or anything that violates public order and morals is strictly prohibited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bug Reports</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find any bugs in the game, please report them via the Community Hub discussion board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Matsusoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908820/header.jpg?t=1771479012","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(c)Matsusoft<br />\r\n(c)SQOOL Co.,Ltd.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2908820/1127090938/9cd376f4449fddaec0ada3c8ed8c57bd20c8e832/1766555356/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766557292","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2908820/1127090938/9cd376f4449fddaec0ada3c8ed8c57bd20